WEBVTT

01:58.200 --> 02:01.200
Mitsuhashi's still working at his job?

02:01.200 --> 02:02.720
You're kidding, right?

02:02.720 --> 02:04.470
I never expected him to stick with it.

02:04.980 --> 02:07.270
He says, "A man's gotta do what a man's gotta do."

02:07.270 --> 02:08.480
Seriously?

02:08.480 --> 02:11.360
Hey, Riko, should we go peek in on him?

02:11.360 --> 02:13.520
Oh, that would be funny!

02:13.520 --> 02:15.620
Are you sure we should do that?

02:15.620 --> 02:17.080
No you can't!

02:18.520 --> 02:21.440
The guy's actually busting his hump for once.

02:21.440 --> 02:23.870
Please don't try to provoke him.

02:23.870 --> 02:26.300
But aren't you the least bit curious?

02:26.300 --> 02:27.330
No dice!

02:27.640 --> 02:30.740
It's cool, Itou. He won't even know we're there.

02:32.820 --> 02:36.490
I <i>will stop you by force if I have to, Sagawa!</i>

02:38.520 --> 02:39.760
Y-You're right.

02:39.760 --> 02:42.480
W-We should leave him be.

02:42.480 --> 02:46.160
Itou, why are you so worked up about this?

02:46.160 --> 02:50.980
If he decides to quit, how will I get my precious Dio back?

02:50.980 --> 02:52.300
Oh, right.

02:52.300 --> 02:52.900
See?

02:53.760 --> 02:56.480
Huh? Why is your arm bandaged?

02:57.240 --> 02:59.200
I-I sort of fell on it.

03:00.720 --> 03:04.540
Anyway, you guys should stay away from where Mitsuhashi's working.

03:04.540 --> 03:06.340
I mean it.

03:09.020 --> 03:10.280
Something happened.

03:10.820 --> 03:13.960
I can see all the warning signs.

03:13.740 --> 03:16.780
Starting  today,  I'll!!

03:14.780 --> 03:16.780
Presented by Saizen-Yabai

03:16.780 --> 03:20.500
THUGS'

03:16.780 --> 03:16.830
LULLABY

03:17.030 --> 03:17.080
COUNTERSTRIKE:

03:20.750 --> 03:24.540
Nanyou Senior High School

03:30.480 --> 03:33.150
I should've limited myself to just three days a week.

03:33.150 --> 03:34.940
Quit your whining.

03:34.940 --> 03:38.610
He's right, Three. This way you can learn how society works.

03:39.500 --> 03:42.990
God! Put yourself in my shoes before saying that!

03:43.400 --> 03:46.190
I'd like to see you kowtowing to customers every day like I do!

03:46.400 --> 03:49.770
Get over yourself! You're still earning money, aren't you?

03:49.770 --> 03:50.400
Riko!

03:50.400 --> 03:53.420
Hey! I ain't working 'cause I want to!

03:58.680 --> 03:59.760
A Dio!

03:59.760 --> 04:02.210
God, they're so tight!

04:03.080 --> 04:04.980
My precious Dio...

04:05.180 --> 04:08.520
Itou, you'll ride another one soon, okay?

04:10.270 --> 04:13.780
And that's why you need to work hard, Three.

04:14.220 --> 04:15.600
I'm off to work!

04:15.600 --> 04:17.690
Have fun!

04:17.470 --> 04:17.510
Niko 39

04:27.320 --> 04:28.840
Misako...

04:32.240 --> 04:34.020
Try and catch me!

04:34.020 --> 04:35.950
Hey, wait!

04:39.540 --> 04:41.200
I'm the luckiest man alive!

04:41.640 --> 04:42.760
What's this?

04:44.640 --> 04:46.820
Look, a crab.

04:46.820 --> 04:49.200
Yeah, it really <i>is a crab.</i>

04:57.060 --> 04:58.520
She smells nice.

04:59.840 --> 05:01.930
All this happiness is filling my lungs!

05:12.140 --> 05:13.460
Dammit!

05:13.460 --> 05:15.740
It's all Mitsuhashi's fault it ended like that!

05:15.740 --> 05:18.040
He wrecked the beautiful thing we had!

05:18.040 --> 05:20.480
I think that's a little bit of a leap.

05:20.480 --> 05:24.140
Mitsuhashi's working right now, so he can't fight back!

05:24.140 --> 05:25.500
Now's our chance, Tanigawa!

05:25.500 --> 05:27.160
Let's do this, Imai!

05:27.160 --> 05:29.360
We'll make him pay for our constant hardships!

05:30.680 --> 05:31.460
With these.

05:31.890 --> 05:33.360
With <i>those?</i>

05:34.430 --> 05:38.480
We'll use these to create an excuse to take him out.

05:38.480 --> 05:41.210
Good! You really are my disciple, Tanigawa!

05:41.210 --> 05:42.270
I'm not your disciple...

05:42.270 --> 05:43.580
We have to hurry!

05:43.580 --> 05:46.230
We must go and make Mitsuhashi pay, Tanigawa!

05:46.230 --> 05:47.440
Hold your horses.

05:48.220 --> 05:48.910
Itou...

05:49.420 --> 05:52.980
I'm sorry, but I'm gonna need you to back off from Mitsuhashi, Imai.

05:53.740 --> 05:56.080
Yeah, I don't know...

05:56.080 --> 06:00.450
Huh? What happened to your arm? Who did you fight?

06:01.500 --> 06:05.540
No one to worry about. They got in a lucky hit.

06:05.540 --> 06:08.480
Anyway, don't pick any fights with Mitsuhashi.

06:08.480 --> 06:10.590
He's trying to earn an honest buck.

06:10.590 --> 06:13.900
But I was going to get him back for everything he did to me.

06:13.900 --> 06:17.000
Yeah, this isn't even about you, Itou!

06:17.000 --> 06:18.160
Are we clear?

06:18.720 --> 06:19.510
Itou?

06:20.280 --> 06:23.200
If you try anything, you answer to me.

06:27.300 --> 06:29.140
What should we do, Imai?

06:29.140 --> 06:32.200
Itou <i>does seem serious about this.</i>

06:32.440 --> 06:35.220
I guess we'll throw him a bone just this once.

06:35.220 --> 06:35.990
Imai!

06:36.580 --> 06:37.720
Thanks, Imai.

06:38.380 --> 06:40.460
Believe me, I owe you one.

06:40.460 --> 06:41.580
Later.

06:44.920 --> 06:49.100
Geez, why did he go out of his way to stop us?

06:50.200 --> 06:52.440
There has to be a good reason.

06:52.440 --> 06:53.850
Wanna find out?

06:53.850 --> 06:54.760
Yeah...

07:01.100 --> 07:03.200
Okay, change of plans!

07:03.720 --> 07:06.920
I'm gonna try my luck again with Misako!

07:07.860 --> 07:11.390
God, it's like talking to a damn wall!

07:11.390 --> 07:12.360
Riko.

07:12.360 --> 07:13.920
What, Ryou?

07:13.920 --> 07:17.370
Itou's really been having Mitsuhashi's back.

07:17.370 --> 07:18.540
I know.

07:18.940 --> 07:21.820
Does he really miss his bike that much?

07:22.960 --> 07:25.020
I'm thinking it's for another reason.

07:25.020 --> 07:26.450
Then why?

07:26.450 --> 07:32.800
He probably wants Three to grow as a human through his job.

07:33.140 --> 07:35.760
He'd be wasting his time trying to reform Mitsuhashi.

07:35.760 --> 07:37.140
Still, Ryou...

07:37.680 --> 07:40.520
I also want Three to grow.

07:41.680 --> 07:43.200
Riko, wait up!

07:43.980 --> 07:45.900
Over here! Come on!

07:45.900 --> 07:47.570
What are you doing?

07:50.200 --> 07:52.500
What's keeping Kyou?

07:53.720 --> 07:55.120
Whoops!

07:55.120 --> 07:55.680
God!

07:55.680 --> 07:56.980
All right.

07:57.700 --> 07:59.320
A little help?

08:01.460 --> 08:03.120
Here I go!

08:20.470 --> 08:23.620
Sh... Shit!

08:23.620 --> 08:26.480
Jumping guys with their backs turned is <i>not cool.</i>

08:26.480 --> 08:27.890
Who the fuck are you?

08:30.000 --> 08:32.100
I've been looking for you, Spikeboy.

08:33.080 --> 08:35.320
Shit... I remember you!

08:35.320 --> 08:38.280
The name's Igarashi. You best remember that, punk.

08:39.170 --> 08:42.410
I kick ass, I don't take names!

08:42.410 --> 08:45.820
Then I'll beat my name into that fucking head of yours.

08:45.820 --> 08:47.300
Stop!

08:48.760 --> 08:50.280
Somebody, help!

08:50.280 --> 08:50.900
Itou!

08:50.900 --> 08:51.660
Shit!

08:53.860 --> 08:55.220
Itou!

08:56.820 --> 08:59.390
Wish you hadn't seen that.

08:59.860 --> 09:01.160
You're bleeding!

09:01.160 --> 09:02.010
You shouldn't move!

09:02.010 --> 09:06.480
N-No. This isn't over.

09:06.480 --> 09:08.840
Are you crazy? You should go to the hospital!

09:08.840 --> 09:10.400
Sorry, but I can't...

09:12.180 --> 09:13.300
Itou?

09:16.910 --> 09:17.440
Itou!

09:17.900 --> 09:19.580
Hang on, Itou!

09:19.580 --> 09:21.910
Itou! Itou!

09:33.860 --> 09:36.630
Can't you take at least one bag, Mitsuhashi?

09:36.630 --> 09:38.260
That's asking too much!

09:38.260 --> 09:39.440
Man...

09:39.440 --> 09:41.780
And he still earns the same as me!

09:50.640 --> 09:52.860
'Sup, Blondie?

09:53.980 --> 09:56.280
We sure had fun the other day.

09:56.540 --> 09:59.560
But tonight's gonna be different, asshole!

10:01.010 --> 10:03.260
The Monchichi's giving us the stinkeye.

10:03.260 --> 10:06.040
I'm <i>so scared! Whatever shall we do, Isada?</i>

10:10.260 --> 10:11.960
That shitheel!

10:12.970 --> 10:14.660
I'll knock your teeth out!

10:17.460 --> 10:19.480
Have some of this!

10:23.820 --> 10:25.460
That fucker!

10:25.840 --> 10:27.460
You all right, Igarashi?

10:27.460 --> 10:28.880
Yeah! After him, Tsutsumi!

10:28.880 --> 10:29.850
Got it!

10:30.560 --> 10:32.540
I don't wanna! I don't wanna! I don't wanna!

10:31.620 --> 10:32.540
Come on!

10:32.540 --> 10:33.370
Let's go!

10:33.370 --> 10:34.730
No! I don't wanna!

10:34.730 --> 10:35.850
Don't be like that!

10:36.700 --> 10:38.300
Listen, Isada.

10:38.300 --> 10:40.660
Igarashi's already been softened up.

10:40.660 --> 10:44.440
This is your chance to get some major getback.

10:44.440 --> 10:45.720
You mean it?

10:45.720 --> 10:46.940
I know it!

10:47.720 --> 10:51.540
Yeah, I'm still a gang leader, despite appearances.

10:51.540 --> 10:54.440
I'm gonna make sure he feels my wrath.

10:54.440 --> 10:55.980
Yep, that's the spirit!

10:55.010 --> 10:55.980
What?

11:02.220 --> 11:04.840
Uh, he's fit as a fiddle.

11:05.100 --> 11:07.830
Wow, that's bizarre!

11:08.180 --> 11:10.380
I guess it's on to Plan B.

11:10.380 --> 11:12.800
Isada, hold your own for ten seconds!

11:12.800 --> 11:13.890
You punk!

11:17.230 --> 11:18.180
One!

11:18.460 --> 11:19.620
Two...

11:19.620 --> 11:20.290
Huh?

11:25.540 --> 11:28.910
You just can't find good help these days, eh, Goldilocks?

11:30.020 --> 11:33.530
Christ... he couldn't hold his own for <i>two seconds?</i>

11:33.530 --> 11:36.490
Playtime's over! Come and get me, shithead!

11:37.280 --> 11:38.940
Fine, then.

11:38.940 --> 11:41.790
I'll just show you my special move, Monchichi.

11:42.810 --> 11:44.300
I call it...

11:46.770 --> 11:49.090
The Shinobi Mitsuhashi Special!

11:49.440 --> 11:50.660
Hey! You punk bitch!

11:50.660 --> 11:51.700
Get back here!

11:51.700 --> 11:55.390
Dumbass! You think I'm stupid enough to do that?

11:58.160 --> 11:59.060
What the?

12:09.740 --> 12:10.780
Huh?

12:15.440 --> 12:17.180
Things just got weird.

12:17.180 --> 12:20.630
Is this the douchebag that's been messing with you, Brother?

12:20.630 --> 12:22.070
Brother?

12:23.600 --> 12:25.090
Haven't you heard, Blondie?

12:25.740 --> 12:30.220
Everybody knows who the Igarashi Twins are around here.

12:30.220 --> 12:32.500
Hah! Listen to you!

12:32.500 --> 12:36.160
That just means you can't do shit alone!

12:36.160 --> 12:36.930
Fuck you!

12:40.020 --> 12:40.610
Bastard!

12:42.620 --> 12:44.530
You a fucking Riverdancer?

12:44.530 --> 12:47.540
This guy ain't nothing special, Brother.

12:47.540 --> 12:51.830
Don't let your guard down.
He's a weaselly little shit, you know.

12:51.830 --> 12:54.920
Fuck! Now I'm up against three!

12:54.920 --> 12:56.530
Talk about a disadvantage!

13:01.320 --> 13:04.780
We're gonna teach you what happens...

13:04.780 --> 13:07.340
...when you piss off the twins!

13:08.510 --> 13:10.630
Officer, help me!

13:12.150 --> 13:12.790
Dipshits!

13:12.790 --> 13:13.150
Tooru!

13:13.150 --> 13:13.670
Right!

13:18.020 --> 13:18.940
Bastard!

13:19.760 --> 13:20.970
Isada, quit lying around!

13:23.360 --> 13:24.860
He <i>is a dirty rat bitch.</i>

13:25.520 --> 13:27.860
We're not gonna sit by and let him go!

13:27.860 --> 13:31.390
Tooru, round up our guys! They're not getting out of our turf!

13:31.390 --> 13:32.330
Got it.

13:34.570 --> 13:34.610
Ssaws Heights

13:38.600 --> 13:40.500
Crap, they're on lookout.

13:41.740 --> 13:43.830
What're we gonna do, Mitsuhashi?

13:47.430 --> 13:50.050
Yo, got something else to eat?

13:50.420 --> 13:52.940
That should be the <i>last thing on your mind!</i>

13:52.940 --> 13:54.760
Whaddaya want me to do?

13:55.060 --> 13:58.540
We're in this mess because you can't get your shit together!

13:58.540 --> 14:02.900
God... things would be a whole lot different with Itou around!

14:02.900 --> 14:05.880
Fine, then call up that Itou guy!

14:05.880 --> 14:09.460
Fuck you! I'm not begging like some bitch!

14:09.890 --> 14:14.400
I can take care of Tweedle Dee and Tweedle Dumbass myself.

14:11.040 --> 14:12.360
Sorry...

14:14.400 --> 14:16.520
All right! You're the man, Mitsuhashi!

14:20.600 --> 14:23.060
What are you doing, Mitsuhashi?

14:23.060 --> 14:26.020
I see! You're looking for some weapons!

14:26.020 --> 14:29.720
Nope, just seeing if you're stashing some porn.

14:38.080 --> 14:39.220
They're gone.

14:40.020 --> 14:42.060
Mitsuhashi, wake up!

14:42.060 --> 14:45.540
They're gone! This is our chance, Mitsuhashi!

14:45.540 --> 14:46.480
Mitsuhashi!

14:46.480 --> 14:47.720
Mitsuhashi—

14:48.980 --> 14:51.690
So what are you going to do about school?

15:13.850 --> 15:17.740
...and that's how Three and I met.

15:17.740 --> 15:19.590
Wow, that's so dramatic!

15:19.590 --> 15:20.900
Riko!

15:21.390 --> 15:23.520
Has Mitsuhashi come to school?

15:24.000 --> 15:27.980
Actually, I haven't seen Three or Itou yet. Is something wrong?

15:27.980 --> 15:31.020
Two twin hoodlums are trashing the place demanding to see Mitsuhashi!

15:37.840 --> 15:40.320
Is there anyone at Nanyou who's <i>not a fucking puss?</i>

15:40.320 --> 15:41.740
Hey, Delinquent Duo!

15:41.740 --> 15:42.840
The fuck?

15:45.290 --> 15:48.380
I won't put up with any more of your roughhousing!

15:48.380 --> 15:52.960
Oh my, the boy don't wanna put up with our shit, Brother.

15:54.160 --> 15:55.260
Yeah, what to do...

15:55.820 --> 15:56.620
Well?

15:56.620 --> 16:00.420
What're ya gonna do about it, <i>boy?</i>

16:00.420 --> 16:03.980
Don't make fun of me! I know kenpo!

16:04.980 --> 16:06.120
You guys seeing this?

16:06.120 --> 16:07.680
I'm skeered!

16:09.980 --> 16:12.440
Tooru, you think you can win?

16:12.920 --> 16:14.560
What do you think?!

16:17.260 --> 16:19.400
My younger brother taught himself martial arts.

16:19.400 --> 16:22.880
He can take you on, no sweat.

16:23.360 --> 16:25.000
So whaddaya say, <i>boy?</i>

16:25.960 --> 16:27.960
D-Don't make fun of me!

16:37.860 --> 16:38.650
Ryou!

16:38.650 --> 16:40.720
God! You know you can't handle them!

16:40.720 --> 16:43.100
Hey! What school did you all come from?!

16:43.520 --> 16:45.460
Damn. Teachers.

16:45.460 --> 16:46.800
We gotta bail.

16:46.800 --> 16:48.160
Wait!

16:49.580 --> 16:53.030
What gives you the right to do this?

16:53.030 --> 16:55.000
This is all on Mitsuhashi.

16:55.000 --> 16:56.920
We're the victims in all of this.

16:56.920 --> 16:58.490
Make sure Goldilocks knows...

16:58.490 --> 17:01.520
...the Igarashi Brothers wanna see him.

17:04.600 --> 17:08.240
<i>Three... so you did <i>pull a boner at work.</i></i>

17:09.340 --> 17:12.390
What the heck are you doing right now? God!

17:12.200 --> 17:12.240
Santarou:  We're almost to Mt.    Fuji!

17:12.200 --> 17:12.240
Keep going,
Tobimaru!

17:15.830 --> 17:19.630
"Bwahaha! I'm thy opponent!"
It's the Demon Boss.

17:15.830 --> 17:19.630
•Fight?
•retreat?

17:16.540 --> 17:18.940
What? Goddammit!

17:19.850 --> 17:22.260
I was <i>this close!</i>

17:24.500 --> 17:26.510
Um, Mitsuhashi, how long are you...

17:26.510 --> 17:27.100
Shuddup!

17:27.400 --> 17:28.940
No talking!

17:28.940 --> 17:30.480
S-Sorry.

17:33.640 --> 17:36.060
Niko 39

17:37.560 --> 17:39.740
Huh? That's weird.

17:39.740 --> 17:41.440
What's under here?

17:42.620 --> 17:45.040
That blond bitch ditched school!

17:45.040 --> 17:47.200
Is he still hiding out in that apartment?

17:47.200 --> 17:49.160
All right, have someone check it out.

17:49.160 --> 17:50.900
Don't let him get away!

17:50.900 --> 17:51.160
Right on!

17:54.260 --> 17:56.600
They <i>must be talking about Mitsuhashi.</i>

17:56.600 --> 17:57.600
Probably.

17:58.520 --> 18:00.600
What should we do, Imai?

18:00.600 --> 18:02.020
Leave it be.

18:02.020 --> 18:04.180
Itou told us to stay put.

18:04.180 --> 18:05.080
But...

18:06.440 --> 18:08.920
Haven't seen the likes of them before.

18:08.920 --> 18:11.090
Mitsuhashi probably fucked with them at his job.

18:12.060 --> 18:16.570
If they and Mitsuhashi take each other out, we'll be sitting pretty.

18:16.570 --> 18:19.070
We don't even have to <i>shoot</i> the fish in the barrel.

18:20.920 --> 18:22.040
I swear...

18:22.040 --> 18:22.820
Let's run!

18:22.820 --> 18:23.660
Right!

18:24.340 --> 18:26.360
They're shoplifting!

18:26.360 --> 18:28.300
You got some balls doing that!

18:28.300 --> 18:28.990
Get back here!

18:37.360 --> 18:39.800
Do I need to be done with you?

18:43.180 --> 18:46.480
They really messed up the place.

18:46.480 --> 18:49.480
We're sorry, Itou. We couldn't stop them.

18:50.200 --> 18:53.180
Don't beat yourself up, Sagawa. It ain't your fault.

18:53.940 --> 18:57.240
Anyway, did they say they were the Igarashis?

18:57.240 --> 19:02.000
Yes, they're the Igarashi Twins, and they're pretty notorious.

19:02.000 --> 19:03.200
I knew it!

19:03.600 --> 19:06.880
They wanted us to give up Mitsuhashi.

19:06.880 --> 19:10.020
Did Mitsuhashi get himself into real trouble?

19:10.020 --> 19:11.440
We should go save him!

19:11.760 --> 19:14.610
Hey, are you forgetting who he is?

19:14.610 --> 19:16.060
He's <i>the Mitsuhashi.</i>

19:16.060 --> 19:17.170
Yeah.

19:17.540 --> 19:21.560
You guys should solidify our defenses here. Okay?

19:21.560 --> 19:22.640
Got it.

19:22.640 --> 19:23.380
I'm counting on you.

19:23.380 --> 19:24.160
Okay!

19:28.960 --> 19:31.260
Game                                     Over

19:33.200 --> 19:35.060
All right...

19:35.060 --> 19:36.960
I think it's time.

19:37.800 --> 19:40.390
I'll prolly catch those guys sleeping.

19:40.390 --> 19:43.230
You're really gonna go up against them?

19:43.680 --> 19:46.460
You know I can't hide out here forever.

19:46.930 --> 19:49.360
Don't worry about me. I can handle 'em alone.

19:50.140 --> 19:51.700
Thanks for letting me crash here, Isada.

19:52.580 --> 19:53.720
Mitsuhashi!

19:53.720 --> 19:56.660
Be sure to punch me in at work.

20:23.350 --> 20:23.390
Sorry, Kyou
something
came up
-Itou

20:27.800 --> 20:29.320
Kyouko!

20:31.680 --> 20:32.460
What's wrong?

20:32.460 --> 20:36.000
I was supposed to meet up with Itou so we could go to the hospital.

20:36.000 --> 20:38.800
I should have known. He must be down at Three's workplace.

20:38.800 --> 20:39.990
Let's go, Kyouko.

21:10.980 --> 21:13.800
That lousy punk, where'd he go?

21:23.460 --> 21:26.320
Whoa, that was a close one!

21:26.800 --> 21:27.920
When did he...

21:27.920 --> 21:29.350
What're you, a monkey?!

21:29.660 --> 21:32.080
You're the monkey, Monchichi!

21:32.080 --> 21:37.310
So, are you that two-stepper or are you the baton twirler?

21:38.400 --> 21:41.770
We can't fucking hear you, so get your monkey ass down here!

21:43.360 --> 21:45.240
Fine, you win this round.

21:45.640 --> 21:47.860
Down I go!

21:49.120 --> 21:51.520
You think you can fucking dropkick <i>me?!</i>

21:53.080 --> 21:53.950
What?!

21:57.000 --> 21:58.700
You... sonuvabitch.

21:59.900 --> 22:01.060
Dumbass!

22:07.700 --> 22:09.380
What the fuck did you do?

22:10.960 --> 22:13.510
<i>My monkey ass is smarter than you think.</i>

22:13.510 --> 22:15.180
You goddamn...

22:17.620 --> 22:19.690
You and your goddamn contraptions.

22:20.520 --> 22:22.930
You ain't getting outta here alive!

22:24.620 --> 22:25.820
Whoops!

22:29.100 --> 22:31.480
You think I'll fall for your same lame tricks?

22:32.540 --> 22:33.640
Fuck!

22:34.840 --> 22:36.000
Whoops!

22:36.000 --> 22:38.400
God, what's with you, Tooru?

22:38.760 --> 22:41.140
Is he giving you <i>that much trouble?</i>

22:41.760 --> 22:42.530
Fuggit.

22:49.060 --> 22:49.940
Shithead!

22:51.240 --> 22:53.380
Where do you think <i>you're going?</i>

22:53.380 --> 22:56.100
Your beef's with me!

22:56.400 --> 22:59.420
Get your filthy fucking hands off me!

23:00.220 --> 23:05.320
If I leave the likes of you running around, a guy can't even fucking play soccer.

23:05.320 --> 23:07.650
I'll be the one to end your reign of terror.

23:08.800 --> 23:10.650
I laid you out with one blow!

23:10.650 --> 23:14.260
This time I'll crush your legs so that you can't even stagger around!

23:20.100 --> 23:22.000
Goddamn porcupine!

23:22.000 --> 23:24.120
I didn't come all the way out here for nothing.

23:24.120 --> 23:25.870
Do or die, motherfucker!

23:27.420 --> 23:27.960
Itou?

23:27.960 --> 23:29.170
What're you looking at?

23:29.170 --> 23:30.160
Fuck you!

23:31.380 --> 23:33.040
Tooru! You okay?

23:33.900 --> 23:35.140
Goddammit!

23:35.140 --> 23:37.000
I guess we're all here.

23:38.200 --> 23:41.970
Let's decide this once and for all, Igarashi Brothers!

23:42.360 --> 23:43.540
Fuck your bullshit!

23:43.540 --> 23:48.440
Ain't you heard? The two of us put together are invincible!

23:48.440 --> 23:50.900
You're the ones who ain't heard!

23:50.900 --> 23:54.160
We're the baddest duo ever to walk the earth!

23:54.160 --> 23:58.260
We're Mitsuhashi and Itou of Nanyou High.

23:58.260 --> 24:00.570
Remember that, punks!

24:03.420 --> 24:04.960
Imai...

24:04.960 --> 24:07.280
What is it, Tanigawa?

24:07.280 --> 24:10.340
Why are we skiing in the middle of summer?

24:10.340 --> 24:16.200
Misako mentioned she wanted to ski, so we need to do a dry run.

24:16.200 --> 24:20.400
You could go there by yourself. Why do you even need me?

24:20.400 --> 24:21.560
Tanigawa...

24:21.560 --> 24:22.920
Okay, fine.

24:24.120 --> 24:26.220
Huh, are they...

24:33.570 --> 24:37.120
All's left is you guys, the Monchichi Twins.

24:37.120 --> 24:40.100
I'll take you guys alone if you want.

24:40.100 --> 24:42.400
No! I wanna get in a punch!

24:42.400 --> 24:44.340
Hell no! Let me take care of this!

24:44.340 --> 24:46.200
Nope! I'll do it!

24:46.200 --> 24:50.210
Hey, quit talking like we ain't here!

24:50.210 --> 24:52.170
Are you two a fucking comedy duo?

24:52.170 --> 24:55.380
Hey, who're you calling a comedy duo?

24:55.380 --> 24:57.040
They got it right!

24:58.420 --> 25:03.000
We three make the greatest comedy trio! Right, Mitsuhashi?

25:03.000 --> 25:05.850
Imai, what are you wearing?

25:05.850 --> 25:08.400
Can't you tell? I'm going skiing! With skis!

25:09.100 --> 25:12.220
Uh, Brother, we now got three stooges.

25:12.220 --> 25:14.110
Who the fuck are these guys?

25:14.110 --> 25:16.700
Don't you change <i>inside the slope?</i>

25:16.700 --> 25:17.680
No way!

25:17.680 --> 25:20.280
And you don't even have to bring shit with you either!

25:20.280 --> 25:21.480
You're kidding!

25:23.280 --> 25:25.440
Anyway, I'm gonna deal with you!

25:26.240 --> 25:27.540
No, no...

25:27.900 --> 25:31.250
I know you two shoplifted from my store, dammit!

25:31.920 --> 25:36.500
I'll teach you fuckers what happens when you piss off Imai of Beni High!

25:36.500 --> 25:39.820
The rest of you witness just how strong I am!

25:50.720 --> 25:52.820
We saw it all right, Imai.

25:52.820 --> 25:54.820
God, Imai!

25:55.760 --> 25:58.390
We don't fucking know that complete stranger!

25:59.040 --> 26:02.280
Follow me and hit him when he ducks.

26:03.940 --> 26:06.110
Bastard! I'm splitting your head open!

26:07.580 --> 26:08.860
Here we go!

26:09.260 --> 26:10.600
Yeah right!

26:10.600 --> 26:11.660
What?

26:12.060 --> 26:13.630
Was <i>this your plan?</i>

26:15.220 --> 26:16.080
Saw right through it!

26:16.080 --> 26:17.820
You basta—

26:18.720 --> 26:20.930
No sightseeing, asshole!

26:24.520 --> 26:26.000
Who <i>are they?</i>

26:27.100 --> 26:29.210
We told you we're the baddest duo...

26:29.210 --> 26:30.650
...to ever walk the earth!

26:31.160 --> 26:32.100
There!

26:34.580 --> 26:37.600
Here! Take that! And that! And that!

26:37.600 --> 26:38.070
And this!

26:46.120 --> 26:48.580
I can't leave Imai alone.

26:49.380 --> 26:50.870
Imai?

26:51.320 --> 26:55.740
If Imai is all beat up, then that means those two...

26:55.740 --> 26:56.820
...are nearby!

27:04.440 --> 27:05.420
There they are!

27:14.300 --> 27:17.240
I don't think the one on the left had enough.

27:19.640 --> 27:20.010
Take that!

27:20.010 --> 27:21.420
Whoops, that was too much.

27:21.420 --> 27:23.180
Here's one for you then!

27:23.180 --> 27:27.830
Dang, I can't get these Doublemint Twins to match up.

27:27.830 --> 27:30.680
Mitsuhashi, just leave them alone.

27:43.540 --> 27:45.860
Son of a bitch!

27:45.860 --> 27:49.060
Why do I have to spend what was supposed to be my day off cleaning?

27:49.640 --> 27:53.700
It only happened after they caught me punching in your card.

27:53.700 --> 27:55.900
You're the one who decided to do that!

27:55.900 --> 27:57.320
Not me!

27:57.320 --> 27:58.920
Hey, come on!

27:59.500 --> 28:00.800
We're closed for the day...

28:08.720 --> 28:10.820
Don't you guys fucking learn?!

28:10.820 --> 28:11.710
Wanna go another round?!

28:12.140 --> 28:13.440
Uh, no.

28:13.440 --> 28:17.170
We realized that you were as strong as advertised.

28:17.170 --> 28:20.170
We want to mend fences with you.

28:20.170 --> 28:22.700
So we came to apologize.

28:22.700 --> 28:23.880
Right?

28:25.680 --> 28:27.340
To apologize?

28:27.340 --> 28:30.310
This is just a small token. Here.

28:30.310 --> 28:31.900
What, you sure?

28:31.900 --> 28:33.040
Gee, thanks.

28:33.040 --> 28:34.110
It's nothing.

28:34.110 --> 28:36.000
Please, take it.

28:36.000 --> 28:37.050
You mean it?

28:37.560 --> 28:40.730
I know! Since you're both here, I'll get you some coffee.

28:41.200 --> 28:42.780
You guys have a seat!

28:42.780 --> 28:44.780
Oh, don't fuss over us!

28:48.440 --> 28:49.360
Uh...

28:52.640 --> 28:55.960
Are you sure you're okay with me eating all of these?

28:55.960 --> 28:59.240
Sure I'm sure, I can't stand sweet stuff.

28:59.240 --> 29:00.860
But it's good.

29:00.860 --> 29:01.600
Really?

29:01.600 --> 29:02.460
Yeah.

29:02.460 --> 29:03.440
Nothing's wrong with it?

29:03.440 --> 29:05.540
Nope, nothing...

29:07.180 --> 29:08.600
You sure?

29:13.320 --> 29:14.220
He's...

29:15.080 --> 29:16.800
So they <i>did pull something!</i>

29:21.850 --> 29:23.560
MOP RAG

29:35.400 --> 29:38.990
Don't try this at home

29:40.100 --> 29:42.360
Pee-yew!

29:42.840 --> 29:45.160
Need some cinnamon and sugar to cover up the smell.

29:46.760 --> 29:49.860
And top it off with some of their cake.

29:50.540 --> 29:55.440
I'll teach 'em what happens when you try fucking with me.

29:56.580 --> 29:57.860
That guy's probably...

29:57.860 --> 29:58.490
Yeah!

29:58.490 --> 30:00.260
Sorry for the wait!

30:00.260 --> 30:02.150
Really liked the cake! Yum, yum!

30:02.150 --> 30:03.740
Y-You did?

30:05.060 --> 30:07.880
Yo, don't just sit there, get over here!

30:07.880 --> 30:08.910
Oh, sure.

30:08.910 --> 30:10.620
It's my own special blend.

30:10.960 --> 30:12.020
It's thanks for the cake.

30:12.020 --> 30:14.260
Drink up! I got more if you want!

30:14.260 --> 30:15.200
Thanks.

30:20.500 --> 30:21.450
Too sweet!

30:21.820 --> 30:23.620
Hey, you saying you don't like it?

30:24.820 --> 30:26.090
No, quite the opposite!

30:26.090 --> 30:27.340
Then drink!

30:27.340 --> 30:30.320
Do it in one gulp before it gets cold, come on!

30:36.380 --> 30:38.700
Whatcha think? Ain't it great?

30:39.860 --> 30:41.090
Thanks for the coffee!

30:41.540 --> 30:43.430
Oh, it was nothing.

30:43.430 --> 30:45.420
A-Anyway, Mitsuhashi...

30:45.420 --> 30:47.120
Oh, what is it?

30:47.120 --> 30:49.920
Uh, don't you feel sick?

30:49.920 --> 30:51.380
Like how?

30:51.380 --> 30:54.120
Like is your stomach churning?

30:55.520 --> 30:56.460
Yay!

30:56.460 --> 30:57.720
Yay, indeed!

30:58.600 --> 31:00.360
Huh, that's strange.

31:02.180 --> 31:06.920
So how did you like my laxative-cream wrung-out-mop-rag coffee?

31:06.920 --> 31:08.260
Whaat?

31:11.040 --> 31:15.340
Dipshits! You think I'd fall for that lame-ass trick!

31:15.340 --> 31:16.090
Whaat?

31:16.420 --> 31:17.300
Fuck you!

31:24.560 --> 31:25.190
God...

31:25.190 --> 31:26.040
...dammit!

31:26.040 --> 31:28.110
He glued our asses to the chair!

31:28.110 --> 31:32.440
Man, you gotta love the strength of these new superglues.

31:34.070 --> 31:35.420
You little shit!

31:35.420 --> 31:36.240
Y—

31:37.880 --> 31:39.820
Th-The bathroom comes first.

31:39.820 --> 31:41.030
Yeah.

31:41.500 --> 31:43.000
R-Relax.

31:43.000 --> 31:44.500
Take it one step at a time.

31:53.080 --> 31:56.040
Yeah, guys! Keep it up! You can do it!

31:56.520 --> 31:57.630
Shit...

32:02.240 --> 32:03.480
It... It's locked!

32:03.480 --> 32:06.440
Who are you, fuckwit? Get outta there now!

32:06.440 --> 32:08.210
Open up! Come on!

32:08.210 --> 32:09.570
Get the fuck out!

32:09.570 --> 32:11.600
I'm scared.

32:10.100 --> 32:11.600
Dumbfuck!

32:11.600 --> 32:13.660
My tummy hurts.

32:13.660 --> 32:16.120
Outside. We're using an outside toilet.

32:16.120 --> 32:17.200
Right.

32:17.200 --> 32:20.060
Now don't rush it. Slowly...

32:20.060 --> 32:22.820
One, two... One, two...

32:28.000 --> 32:29.680
Take care.

32:32.060 --> 32:35.240
Don't do that, shit-for-brains!

32:36.360 --> 32:37.880
D-Don't!

32:39.260 --> 32:41.220
Peace out!

32:42.160 --> 32:44.520
Please open it up, Mitsuhashi, sir!

32:44.520 --> 32:46.820
We were wrong!

32:54.520 --> 32:54.560
STATION

32:54.520 --> 32:54.560
SHOPPING

32:54.520 --> 32:54.560
DISTRICT

32:54.520 --> 32:54.560
Now

32:54.520 --> 32:54.560
Doing

32:54.520 --> 32:54.560
Summer

32:54.520 --> 32:54.560
Lottos

32:58.940 --> 33:02.030
Of course they'd fire you after that!

33:02.030 --> 33:04.860
What's done is done!

33:04.860 --> 33:07.040
I'm done with being a wage slave!

33:07.040 --> 33:09.840
Then how'll I get my Dio back?

33:10.720 --> 33:12.310
Don't sweat the small stuff.

33:12.310 --> 33:13.940
"Small stuff" my ass!

33:15.100 --> 33:16.260
What the?

33:19.250 --> 33:19.290
1st
Prize

33:23.100 --> 33:26.440
It's a Dio! They're so tight!

33:26.440 --> 33:28.200
I-Itou...

33:28.200 --> 33:31.340
Three, you need to find another job.

33:34.800 --> 33:35.940
Itou.

33:36.600 --> 33:36.640
Lottery Ticket

33:38.120 --> 33:42.780
Don't worry, I'll get you your precious Dio right now.

33:42.780 --> 33:45.170
Are you nuts? You're nowhere near that lucky—

33:45.170 --> 33:46.350
Trust me!

33:46.350 --> 33:47.470
Pops, hit me!

33:47.470 --> 33:48.790
You got it!

33:50.480 --> 33:54.380
All you need to do is spin it hard!

34:00.800 --> 34:02.710
Oh my gosh!

34:02.900 --> 34:05.670
We got a special prize winner!

34:05.670 --> 34:07.430
Yeah! You did it!

34:07.430 --> 34:08.320
Oh my God...

34:08.320 --> 34:10.220
You're awesome! You're awesome, Mitsuhashi!

34:10.220 --> 34:12.280
Now I can ride my Dio!

34:14.190 --> 34:15.720
Congratulations!

34:15.720 --> 34:20.100
Your special prize is the top-of-the-line, 39-inch, widescreen stereo TV!

34:21.040 --> 34:22.490
It's not a Dio?

34:24.540 --> 34:26.070
I pity you.

34:28.650 --> 34:28.690
Widescreen

34:29.280 --> 34:33.370
I still get surprised by how extremely quirky Three can be.

34:33.700 --> 34:37.280
I'm glad. That thing's way more expensive than a motorbike.

34:37.280 --> 34:40.060
My feelings are still mixed up about it.

34:40.060 --> 34:42.050
If you don't want it, I'll take it!

34:42.050 --> 34:44.210
I didn't say I didn't want it!

34:44.900 --> 34:47.200
But I wish I had my Dio...

34:47.960 --> 34:50.700
Will you stop being such a puss!

34:50.700 --> 34:53.680
Like you got a right to talk, Mitsuhashi!

34:54.060 --> 34:57.920
A guy should never waver over anything!

34:57.920 --> 35:01.080
I'm not taking that from an idiot like you!

35:01.520 --> 35:03.570
Three, you better find another job.

35:03.570 --> 35:04.420
Can it!

35:07.070 --> 35:07.110
Presented by Saizen-Yabai

35:07.070 --> 35:07.110
Starting  today,  I'll!!

35:09.940 --> 35:09.990
COUNTERSTRIKE:

35:09.940 --> 35:09.990
THUGS' LULLABY

35:14.840 --> 35:16.920
Let's worry about the future tomorrow.

35:16.920 --> 35:19.420
When tomorrow comes, it'll all work out.

35:22.930 --> 35:24.970
If it doesn't work out, I'll just run away.

35:24.970 --> 35:27.430
If I'm found, I'll make up an excuse.

35:30.930 --> 35:32.940
You and me are friends, partner.

35:32.940 --> 35:34.610
If the going gets tough, the tough say goodbye.

35:38.900 --> 35:40.990
I help you.

35:39.820 --> 35:40.990
We're family.

35:40.990 --> 35:42.950
I like you.

35:54.920 --> 35:56.880
On stressful days, I'll hit you.

35:56.880 --> 35:59.590
Then, I'll say, "I'm sorry," and you'll forgive me.

36:02.800 --> 36:04.340
That cute girl is mine,

36:04.340 --> 36:07.470
but I belong to no one.

36:10.890 --> 36:12.890
We're all brothers and sisters in this world.

36:12.890 --> 36:14.850
When the going gets tough, the tough kick and scream.

36:38.910 --> 36:39.370
MOP RAG

37:15.300 --> 37:16.680
See you next time!
